Pros: Easy to Navigate
Pros: Provide Structure Data Set', e'Cons: Linked Analysis Between Model
Cons: Improvement of Forecasting Templates (make sure we can have 2 versions open at the same time). The Rolling Fcst Layout seem to only allow 1 version at a time
